        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVWIN19, Ornate Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate comes in your choice of beautiful finishes including satin nickel and polished brass. This ornate knobset features an extra big backplate that is 11 inches tall and 2.65 inches wide, making it a great choice for either big doors or expansive rooms. Even on a standard sized door, the Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Windsor Knob will look amazing, creating stunning design by pairing the classic elegance of the Fifth Ave Plate with the fanciness of the Windsor Knob. The Ornate Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is available in dummy, passage or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/keyed-entry-set-windsor-knob-with-fifth-avenue-tall-plate-grandeur-favwin19entr\"><b> Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entryset.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVWIN19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262365\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVWIN19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
