                "description": "The Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate comes in your choice of beautiful finishes including satin nickel and polished brass. This ornate knobset features an extra big backplate that is 11 inches tall and 2.65 inches wide, making it a great choice for either big doors or expansive rooms. Even on a standard sized door, the Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Windsor Knob will look amazing, creating stunning design by pairing the classic elegance of the Fifth Ave Plate with the fanciness of the Windsor Knob. The Ornate Windsor Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is available in dummy, passage or privacy functions.\r\n",
